Subject: [BioC] Finding GO leaf nodes for an ontology - which package?
In-Reply-To: <136328.85533.qm@web58003.mail.re3.yahoo.com> (Tim Smith's
	message of "Fri\, 27 Jul 2007 07\:42\:10 -0700 \(PDT\)")
References: <136328.85533.qm@web58003.mail.re3.yahoo.com>
